            "sid": "1CH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And these are the singers, heads of fathers’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the Levites, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in the chambers ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " free ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for they were employed in their work day and night. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were heads of fathers’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the Levites, throughout their generations, chief men: these dwelt at Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
